      "statement": "step ca bootstrap dispatches on flags: --team is incompatible with --ca-url or --fingerprint, --team defaults --team-authority to 'ssh', --team-authority requires --team, and otherwise --ca-url plus --fingerprint are required to call BootstrapAuthority.",
