      "id": "claim_5e85bb3259a347a58c933b300997466d",
      "statement": "BootstrapTeamAuthority defaults the endpoint to https://api.smallstep.com/v1/teams/<team>/authorities/<teamAuthority>, replaces the <> placeholder in --team-url with the team name, parses a JSON response with url/fingerprint/redirect-url/provisioner/min-password-length, defaults the redirect to https://smallstep.com/app/teams/sso/success when neither the flag nor the API provides one, and names the default context <teamAuthority>.<team>.",
